{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_001_01_j",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:121e0477e9e7518bd81297dda22d87acd0eddcaa7b3983cb575f847b9e0e6467",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0f2577806157b85431ab0b99779090df5be0aa50e5f301ec7540d44b35e79b0",
      "text": "好的，我明白了。\n那么接下来……这样的表情，如何呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55c7816d32ff9a56e201010158aa3a1fbeac264a7eddf565511f6b10bad9f127",
      "text": "啊，OK了吗？\n拍得很漂亮呢，非常感谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d5262ff55567b3eae7a90e981be34dcc6916c9e619a4aee76f65569079e3b16",
      "text": "哇——，北斗君只是抛了个媚眼，\n工作人员们就骚动起来了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1472f5d7948be7ac2937034a0dcd0c2399a7d04cc0167e8b605aa87bf9fad61",
      "text": "听他说之前当过模特，看来很清楚\n怎样才能展现出自己最好的一面呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2654e50c8fec3f32185c4b6a22f32dbbd7a109f8adefaca9f0f4244479da1044",
      "text": "是啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d81dc41d2aab1f2f3831ac78e95e4f639af5e6a1c6735c6ce3d9f59f575dc7e8",
      "text": "（没想到这家伙居然有这种实力……\n我也不能认输！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000101:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b8d30669d734c10f02010a98cec3bd34fa99fd8fab70801fd1b32e6d58e4be0",
      "text": "我回来了，冬马、翔太。\n最后是三个人的合照，不过……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000105:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:52b9599f0b525cf09b6d6e6e570b30441db4849d55e95f9b44222157d1962f35",
      "text": "噢！我来大显身手给你们看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc5c67cd3c3e7b15d849bb60b2e7557c78eed6f65d347b7e5dc2c084040ac1c3",
      "text": "哎呀？突然很有干劲嘛。\n是看了北斗君的拍摄后，终于被点燃斗志了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:576089e2812351a770838cccac41471677085013c0828d5f72c277471f776406",
      "text": "我说了我从一开始就很有干劲啦！\n只是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000130:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:502d32425c1bce54e97270d3b8632f94cdf876778b04141226a26fa8813987f0",
      "text": "（近距离看着对手的模样……果然很有趣啊。\n这次轮到我让他们大吃一惊了！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_001jup_01_1_1_001_01:1_1_001_01_j:cmd-000148:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f1cb1f3e9c23f134f30d13bf8d9956eba204f07d9b229d337e9dc8da20fd4fe6",
      "text": "……呵呵。一开始虽然摆出一副冷酷的样子，\n但意外的是个很热血的人呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
